@startuml
actor User as "Claude / Cursor Client"
participant MCPServer as "FastMCP Server"
participant Backend as "FastAPI Backend"
database Supabase as "Supabase Postgres"

== OAuth Sign-In Flow ==
User -> MCPServer : Trigger Connection
MCPServer --> User : Prompt for Login (OAuth Consent URL)
User -> Backend : Open Browser for consent
Backend --> User : Redirect with OAuth Auth Code
User -> MCPServer : Send code
MCPServer -> Backend : POST /oauth/token (Exchange code)
Backend --> MCPServer : Return Access Token & Refresh Token

== Tool Execution Flow ==
User -> MCPServer : Run Tool (e.g. list_decks)
MCPServer -> MCPServer : verify_token(JWT)
alt Token Valid
    MCPServer -> Backend : GET /decks (With Bearer Access Token)
    Backend -> Supabase : SELECT * FROM decks WHERE user_id
    Supabase --> Backend : Return data
    Backend --> MCPServer : Return deck list
    MCPServer --> User : Output JSON representation
else Token Expired
    MCPServer -> Backend : POST /oauth/token (grant_type=refresh_token)
    Backend --> MCPServer : Return new Access Token
    MCPServer -> Backend : Retry tool API call
end
@enduml
